    metaTitle: 'Mortgage Refinancing Guide: When It Makes Sense | Money Director',
    metaDescription: 'Learn when mortgage refinancing is worth it, how to calculate the break-even point, and the steps to refinance your home loan for a lower rate or better terms.',
    slug: 'how-to-refinance-your-mortgage',
    excerpt: 'Refinancing your mortgage can save you thousands, but only if the timing and numbers work. This guide explains when to refinance, how to calculate the break-even point, and the steps involved.',
    featuredImage: 'https://images.pexels.com/photos/8293781/pexels-photo-8293781.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=650&w=940',
    imageAlt: 'Calculator with keys and real estate documents for home refinancing',
    authorId: 'marcus-reid',
